      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 Email AI triage\n\nManual demo: run **Manual Trigger (sample email)**. It uses a synthetic email, so the Gmail nodes will fail on the sample message id. Inspect **Parse Classification** output, which is the demo result.\n\nLive mode: activate the Gmail trigger path. Drafts are created, never sent.\n\nRequired env vars: `LLM_BASE_URL`, `LLM_API_KEY`, `LLM_MODEL`, `GMAIL_LABEL_IDS_JSON`.\n\nNo network call happens until you configure a real endpoint and key.",
